    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a [\u5bff\u58eb(Sushi)], a craftsman who loves sushi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to become the top sushi king with unique characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online battle for up to 3 people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who collects two pieces of sushi before the other players wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the side menu to your advantage! ! !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb25 types of popular sushi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can eat sushi (in the game)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Grill sushi, order miso soup, and order dessert! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can play against random players or against your friends.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a [\u5bff\u58eb(Sushi)], a craftsman who loves sushi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to become the top sushi king with unique characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online battle for up to 3 people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player who collects two pieces of sushi before the other players wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the side menu to your advantage! ! !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb25 types of popular sushi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbYou can eat sushi (in the game)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Grill sushi, order miso soup, and order dessert! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can play against random players or against your friends.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u201cSushi ou\u201d is a mahjong-style board game that allows up to three players to compete online!Become a [\u5bff\u58eb(Sushi)], a craftsman who loves sushi, and aim to become the sushi king with unique characters!",
